1
00:00:00,225 --> 00:00:01,895
(Leonard:)You said candles were dangerous.

2
00:00:02,060 --> 00:00:03,890
(Sheldon:)This is a Bunsen burner.

3
00:00:05,689 --> 00:00:08,069
(Sheldon:)I'm a scientist. I know what I'm doing.

4
00:00:09,192 --> 00:00:10,612
(Sheldon:)Oh, drat.

5
00:00:15,949 --> 00:00:20,449
Oh. It took me a gallon of urine
to make that water.

6
00:00:23,832 --> 00:00:27,292
(Leonard:)Listen, Sheldon, this is stupid.
I don't see why we can't be friends.

7
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:30,210
(Leonard:)I'm willing to drive you
and help you out with stuff...

8
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:32,920
(Leonard:)...I just don't want to
because of some agreement.

9
00:00:33,591 --> 00:00:37,011
- What are you proposing?
- That we go back to the way things were.

10
00:00:37,178 --> 00:00:40,468
(Leonard:)But when I do something for you,
you show a little appreciation.

11
00:00:41,099 --> 00:00:42,979
(Sheldon:)How would I do that?

12
00:00:44,436 --> 00:00:47,686
- You say "thank you."
- Every time?

13
00:00:49,774 --> 00:00:51,274
(Leonard:)It's not crazy.

14
00:00:52,235 --> 00:00:53,815
(Sheldon:)Counter-proposal.

15
00:00:53,987 --> 00:00:57,447
(Sheldon:)We reinstate the full Roommate Agreement
with the following addendum:

16
00:00:57,615 --> 00:01:02,535
(Sheldon:)In the spirit of Mother's Day
or Father's Day, once a year...

